    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always had a strong connection with math, even though I didn’t go far beyond vocational level. I use it daily in economics and for understanding everyday problems. It makes sense to me, even if it's not always fun. I enjoy solving puzzles and understanding patterns, especially when it helps me make better financial choices or plan a trip.",
