    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes, I used a chatbot to clarify algebra concepts. I typed out problems and it explained them step by step. It helped a lot with visualizing the process. The explanations were clear and it reduced my anxiety. I found it especially useful for understanding how to break down a complex equation.",
