    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs can personalize learning by explaining concepts in different ways. They can provide instant feedback and adapt to a student’s pace. They could generate practice problems based on a student's weak areas. This would make learning more interactive and less intimidating, especially for anxious learners like myself."
